WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.147
Four forward compartments flooded?

00:00:02.157 --> 00:00:03.161
She floats.

00:00:03.171 --> 00:00:04.299
Her lower decks:

00:00:04.309 --> 00:00:08.427
sixteen compartments, split by
fifteen watertight bulkheads.

00:00:08.437 --> 00:00:11.242
Watertight doors could
seal them, some closed

00:00:11.252 --> 00:00:12.811
remotely from the bridge.

00:00:12.821 --> 00:00:15.368
The iceberg buckled her starboard plates.

00:00:15.378 --> 00:00:17.809
Six compartments opened to the sea.

00:00:17.819 --> 00:00:20.093
Designed for any two flooded, and some

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:22.059
combinations up to four.

00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:23.566
But the bulkheads weren't sealed at the

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:24.328
top.

00:00:24.338 --> 00:00:26.566
As the bow sank, water spilled over

00:00:26.576 --> 00:00:28.263
each one into the next.
